1
00:00:09,927 --> 00:00:19,845
My mother holds us to her breast,
To welcome us back to the nest.

2
00:00:20,079 --> 00:00:29,857
We step in the tent, in the shade,
Where father's warm table is laid.

3
00:00:30,568 --> 00:00:38,889
He pulls out a little white box,
And opens the heaviest locks.

4
00:00:39,355 --> 00:00:50,475
He says we are children no more,
And opens the ultimate door.

5
00:01:01,441 --> 00:01:11,145
My mother is smiling in peace,
She lets go of her little boy.

6
00:01:11,867 --> 00:01:21,242
The pains of the past now decrease,
And we are just drowning in joy.

7
00:01:22,065 --> 00:01:30,514
I hug him with gratitude’s tear,
With Luna so close and so near.

8
00:01:30,915 --> 00:01:41,535
My mother is smiling in peace,
As pains of the past now decrease.

9
00:01:53,246 --> 00:02:02,334
She kisses his cheek with a smile,
We've walked for a beautiful mile.

10
00:02:03,535 --> 00:02:12,825
We'll sleep in each other tonight,
Our hearts are so warm in the light.

11
00:02:13,862 --> 00:02:22,502
He pulled out a little white box,
And opened the heaviest locks.

12
00:02:22,613 --> 00:02:34,020
He said we are children no more,
And opened the ultimate door.

13
00:02:55,061 --> 00:03:03,701
But none of this ever took place,
No pride on my father's cold face.

14
00:03:03,730 --> 00:03:16,126
"You sleep far apart," is his word,
The cry of my Lion unheard.

15
00:03:19,332 --> 00:03:29,707
The door is now closed and on lock,
We stand in this silence and shock.

16
00:03:29,717 --> 00:03:41,443
Together, yet fully alone,
Behind a cold barrier of stone.

17
00:04:30,561 --> 00:04:37,829
The door is now closed and on lock,
We stand in this silence and shock.

18
00:04:37,988 --> 00:05:00,249
Together, yet fully alone,
Behind a cold barrier of stone

